# Vendor Inventory (Sanitized)

High-level documentation of the vendor inventory module for public archives.

## Overview
- Coordinates item pools exposed to UI clients through abstracted services.
- Applies configurable weighting rules provided by secure backend policies.
- Maintains modular boundaries between hub and run-time vendors.

## Sanitized Notes
- Faction-based weighting details, drop tables, and reward schemas have been removed.
- Integration notes for analytics and entitlement systems are retained privately.
- Refer to the internal commerce specification for exhaustive balancing parameters.
